  "details": "Recently the VRC website has offline friends appear in an almost \"most recently online\" and often not very accurate with days, months, years ago sometimes mixed between each other and no longer in order of adding which I found useful to get an idea of when I met someone\nI want to suggest to have an option to toggle the order friends appear in the list like bringing back the \"added\" order so your most recently added friends appear at the top as well as an option to set it to alphabetical order\nalso a secondary option to invert the order of the list\nSo to put the suggestion simply\nToggles for friend list order:\n-Last online [time] ago\n-Order you friended someone\n-Alphabetical order\n~Invert list order option",
